/* ===== Hiding pane ===== */

/* Hiding pane intro. */
"Makes Cmd+H work even when the app is the last one showing." = "Faz o Cmd+H funcionar mesmo quando o app é o último visível na tela.";

/* Card title and picker label: what happens when only one app is visible on screen. */
"When only one app is showing" = "Quando só um app está visível";

/* App Store build only (shown in the store screenshots, so never say Mac or macOS). Explains how the last app gets hidden. */
"Cmd+H hides the last app completely. While one app or none is showing, CommandH's icon appears in the Dock. That's what lets the last app hide." = "O Cmd+H oculta o último app por completo. Enquanto houver um app visível ou nenhum, o ícone do CommandH aparece no Dock. É isso que permite ocultar o último app.";

/* Radio choice: hide the last app. Sentence case. */
"Hide the app" = "Ocultar o app";

/* Explanation under the Hide the app choice. */
"The app hides completely, like Cmd+H anywhere else. CommandH's icon appears in the Dock while one app or none is showing." = "O app é ocultado por completo, como o Cmd+H faz em qualquer outro caso. O ícone do CommandH aparece no Dock enquanto houver um app visível ou nenhum.";

/* Radio choice: use the system's Show Desktop. Show Desktop is the macOS feature name; use its official localized name. */
"Show Desktop" = "Mostrar Mesa";

/* Explanation under the Show Desktop choice. */
"Windows slide to the edges of the screen, and Cmd+H again brings them back. CommandH never appears in the Dock." = "As janelas deslizam para as bordas da tela, e outro Cmd+H as traz de volta. O CommandH nunca aparece no Dock.";

